{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-033",
    "title": "宗门内战"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_186",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "左列主张立即关闭天门，右列主张趁门缝尚未稳定时进入其中，夺回被太虚遗脉吸收的残印。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "天门第三声鸣响后，陆沉舟的名字从世上消失了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5846,
          "end": 5846
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是从一张名册上消失，而是从所有人的记忆里同时退去。回川城的居民看见天门中的身影，却没人知道那是谁。玄霄宗修士只说门内有一名引灯人，无相寺僧人则说那是一段未归的记忆。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5848,
          "end": 5848
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "只有陆照临还记得。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5850,
          "end": 5850
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他站在钟楼顶端，手里的白灯已经熄灭。掌心残印留下的空白扩大到手腕，金色裂纹则沿气海向上蔓延。刚才失去出生地的痛苦还没有退去，他却清楚记得父亲的名字、声音和那件灰色旧斗篷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5852,
          "end": 5852
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟。”他朝天门喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5854,
          "end": 5854
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内人影停住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5856,
          "end": 5856
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还记得我？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5858,
          "end": 5858
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5860,
          "end": 5860
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就别叫我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5862,
          "end": 5862
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5864,
          "end": 5864
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字会让门找到你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5866,
          "end": 5866
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向脚下。回川城的姓名牌重新出现，却没有一块写着“陆沉舟”。所有牌子都只剩姓氏，唯独一块空白牌子在钟楼边缘轻轻摇晃。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5868,
          "end": 5868
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走上来，把铜环递给他：“它刚才在发热。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5870,
          "end": 5870
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "铜环内侧浮出一行细字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5872,
          "end": 5872
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“无名者不可回返。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5874,
          "end": 5874
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叔父也会这样？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5876,
          "end": 5876
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他已经没有名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5878,
          "end": 5878
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可你还记得他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5880,
          "end": 5880
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得一个人，不代表门承认他存在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5882,
          "end": 5882
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜从楼梯下方走来，肩上重新缠了黑布。归墟盟的黑色旗帜在城外飘动，旗面上没有盟印，只有一道被撕开的白线。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5884,
          "end": 5884
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“盟主派人进城。”他说，“他们要带走天门的第一块门楔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5886,
          "end": 5886
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“门楔是什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5888,
          "end": 5888
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让门保持开启的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5890,
          "end": 5890
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“残印？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5892,
          "end": 5892
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不，是名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5894,
          "end": 5894
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向天门。黑暗中的灯群之间，漂浮着一块青铜碎片。碎片上刻着密密麻麻的人名，最上方三行已经被削平。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5896,
          "end": 5896
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就是门楔。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5898,
          "end": 5898
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他站在钟楼另一侧，手里捧着无相铜镜。镜面照出青铜碎片，却照不出上面的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5900,
          "end": 5900
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字已经被门取走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5902,
          "end": 5902
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“怎么拿回来？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5904,
          "end": 5904
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让门承认他们曾经属于人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5906,
          "end": 5906
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“怎么承认？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5908,
          "end": 5908
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“需要一个仍记得的人作证。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5910,
          "end": 5910
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "所有目光转向陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5912,
          "end": 5912
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只记得我父亲。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5914,
          "end": 5914
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“足够。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5916,
          "end": 5916
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城外传来号角。玄霄宗修士开始在城墙外布阵，白玉令牌连成一片，形成一道封锁光幕。归墟盟的人则从东门潜入，试图靠近天门下方的青铜碎片。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5918,
          "end": 5918
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向陆照临：“你要作证，就必须进入门内。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5920,
          "end": 5920
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“进去会失去名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5922,
          "end": 5922
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经失去出生地。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5924,
          "end": 5924
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还没失去自己的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5926,
          "end": 5926
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以才要快。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5928,
          "end": 5928
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离按住他的手腕：“别进去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5930,
          "end": 5930
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你说过，让门里的人自己说。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5932,
          "end": 5932
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那是对我叔父说的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5934,
          "end": 5934
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟也是门里的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5936,
          "end": 5936
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5938,
          "end": 5938
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "钟楼下，回川城的居民开始聚集。他们举着各自的姓名牌，有人记得完整姓名，有人只记得一个姓，有人连自己是否住在这里都无法确定。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5940,
          "end": 5940
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一个老人走上台阶：“你说门里的人是你父亲？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5942,
          "end": 5942
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5944,
          "end": 5944
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他叫什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5946,
          "end": 5946
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5948,
          "end": 5948
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人重复了一遍，却摇头：“这个名字听起来很陌生。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5950,
          "end": 5950
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向他：“陌生不代表不存在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5952,
          "end": 5952
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你怎么证明？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5954,
          "end": 5954
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“什么灯？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5960,
          "end": 5960
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人在三年前的冬夜，把它放在我家门口。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5962,
          "end": 5962
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻回答：“会回来一部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-101",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6046,
          "end": 6046
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那剩下的呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-102",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6048,
          "end": 6048
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留在门里，继续成为路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-103",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6050,
          "end": 6050
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天门合拢前，陆沉舟最后看了一眼顾长离留下的铜环。铜环内侧浮出一行字：“名字可以借，选择不能。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-104",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6052,
          "end": 6052
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "失去名字的人聚在山脚，他们用彼此的特征互相称呼：长辫子、跛脚、爱唱歌。陆照临替他们写下临时名册，却被一个女孩撕掉。女孩说名字要自己挑，他便把笔递还给她。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-105",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6054,
          "end": 6054
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "后来者可以从这里开始，也可以选择另一条路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-106",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6056,
          "end": 6056
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-107",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6058,
          "end": 6058
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "山脚的人们开始互相讲述失去名字前的生活。跛脚的老人记得自己曾会跳舞，爱唱歌的妇人记得一首无人听完的曲子，长辫子女孩记得母亲总在窗边磨刀。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-108",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6060,
          "end": 6060
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "众人将灯册交给城中抄写员继续保存，并约定每次改动都要留下日期和姓名。新的记录不再只写胜负，也写下犹豫、失误以及没有被选择的道路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-109",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6062,
          "end": 6062
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "已记录。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-110",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6064,
          "end": 6064
        }
      }
    ],
